OL,3,GNEWSAI survived a fire that killed my
OL,4,Aboyfriend - it was started by his
OL,5,Abrother
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter spending the night at a Hogmanay
OL,8,Fparty, Cameron Logan and his girlfriend
OL,9,FBex Williams returned to his family
OL,10,Fhome, in a quiet suburb of Glasgow, in
OL,11,Fthe early hours of New Year's Day 2017.
OL,13,FThe young couple fell asleep on an
OL,14,Finflatable mattress in the living room.
OL,16,FWithin hours, Cameron would be dead and
OL,17,FBex critically injured.
OL,19,FThe couple were attacked by Cameron's
OL,20,Folder brother, who poured petrol over
OL,21,Fthem and set fire to their bed.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
